<title>UK: Dresdner sets warrants on Forbo AG.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets warrants on Forbo AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresder Bank AG has issued 420,000 American-style call warrants, on Forbo AG, lead manager Banque Internationale de Placement said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    600.00 CHF		PREMIUM	11.30 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.00 CHF		  GEARING	9.90 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.APR.97-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  593.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
